.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt TIMER_CREATE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm timer_create
.Nd create a disarmed monotonic timer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn timer_create clock_id flags
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Only CLOCK_MONOTONIC and zero flags are accepted.  The returned timer is an
event source and is armed by
.Xr timer_set 2 .
At most 1024 live timer objects may be created by one process.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EINVAL
The clock is not CLOCK_MONOTONIC or flags is nonzero.
.It Er ENOSPC
The per-process timer limit has been reached.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
